Z||000000||JohnnyK||03-15-2001||09:59 PM||||I recently asked if it possible to install t-tops in a day or two.. What I meant was, I have the WHOLE car, and I want to take the roof of the one car, and put it on my car, and vice versa.. Is THIS possible in a day? Hopefully there will be no cutting or whatever. What snags will I run into? Thanks If it's not possible, I'm sure I have good news for someone in the Toronto area.||||reg||1
Z||000001||fiero56||03-15-2001||10:04 PM||||That would be some sort of world record. I doubt C&C even worked THAT fast. <P>It is not possible to do without cutting. How do you plan to install t-tops on a non t-top Fiero without cutting?||||reg||1
